tops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: Details Available Upon Request, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 1150 sqft to 1400 sqft\n* Project Address: lic colony borivali west, mumbai, maharashtra.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Rajesh Builders\n* RERA Registration No.: To Be Updated\n* Possession Start: 2007-06-13\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nRajesh Raj Madhur benefits from its location in Borivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Rajesh Raj Madhur will begin in 2007-06-13, and the project is RERA registered under To Be Updated. Developed by Rajesh Builders, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Club house