aj Hill in Mumbai spans a total area of 3 acres.\n\n### Which is nearest metro station to Raj Hill?\n\nThe nearest metro station to Raj Hill is Magathane Metro Station. It is 0.6 Kms away from Raj Hill.\n\n### Where can I download the brochure PDF of Raj Hill from?\n\nYou can [download the brochure of Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136#nav-overview) visiting the Project page.\n\nShow more\n\nThis project was last updated on  08 September 2026iView Details\n\nLast Updated Details\n\n* 1 Sale Property 'Posted on Sep 5, 2026'\n* 2 New Property Photos 'Posted on Sep 5, 2026'\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n* [1 BHK Flats for Sale in Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-raj-hill-1bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n* [Flats for Sale in Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-raj-hill-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nProperties for Rent\n\n* [1 BHK Flats for Rent in Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-raj-hill-1bhk-for-rent-in-mumbai-pppfr)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Rent in Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-raj-hill-3bhk-for-rent-in-mumbai-pppfr)\n* [Flats for Rent in Raj Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-raj-hill-for-rent-in-mumbai-pppfr)\n\nQuick Links\n\n* [Raj Hill Amenities](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-amenities-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136)\n* [Raj Hill Floor Plan](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-floor-plan-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136)\n* [Raj Hill Location](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-location-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136)\n* [Raj Hill Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-photo-videos-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136)\n* [Raj Hill Reviews](https://www.magicbricks.com/raj-hill-reviews-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303031353136)\n\nView More\n\nNew Launched Projects\n\nView More\n\nNew Popular Projects\n\nView More\n\nNew High Demand Projects\n\nView More\n\nNearby Ready To Move Projects\n\nView More\n\nPopular Ready To Move Projects\n\nView More\n\nHigh Demand Ready To Move Projects\n\nView More\n\nPre-Launch Projects\n\nProperties in Borivali East\n\nReal Estate Searches\n\nView More\n\nPopular Stories Around You\n\n[![Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai\")\n\nMumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai\n\nMumbai Metro Line 3 is 33.5 km long, spanning from Cuffe Parade to Aarey Colony, and comprises 27 stations. The third phase of the metro route became operational on October 08, 2025. Read to know more.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/metro-line-3-mumbai/130855.html)\n\n[![Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News\")\n\nMumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News\n\nMumbai Metro kick started in 2006 with an aim to improve the connectivity in Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Follow this blog to know about the routes and stations of Mumbai Metro network.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-metro/127715.html)\n\n[![Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai\")\n\nSalman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai\n\nThe 'Bhai' of Bollywood, Salman Khan is an avid investor. While he enjoys a grounded lifestyle, he owns many properties that add to his net worth. Check out Salman Khan's house in Galaxy Apartments and other places.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-salman-khan-house/125451.html)\n\n[![Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More\")\n\nHarbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More\n\nThis blog delves into one of the three lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/harbour-line-mumbai/131092.html)\n\n[![Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More\")\n\nCentral Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More\n\nThe Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/central-line-mumbai/131048.html)\n\n[![Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line\")\n\nMumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line\n\nVersova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro - also called the Reliance Metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route/131129.html)\n\n[![Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B\")\n\nYellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B\n\nThe Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html)\n\n[![Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More\")\n\nWestern Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More\n\nThe local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html)\n\n[![Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?\")\n\nMumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?\n\nIndia's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html)\n\n[![Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27\")\n\nReady Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27\n\nReady reckoner in Mumbai is affected by the age and location of the property. Also, I know how to check the ready reckoner rate on the Maharashtra government website.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html)\n\n[![Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\")\n\nMumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\n\nThe upcoming Mumbai Ahmedabad bullet train transforms connectivity, boosts property values, and opens new real estate investment hubs across tier-2 cities along its 508 km corridor.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-ahmedabad-bullet-train-jkmb/150885.html)\n\n[![Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility\")\n\nMumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility\n\nMHADA Mumbai Lottery offers affordable residential units for the homeless. The post covers active Mumbai MHADA Lottery schemes, with dates, eligibility criteria, documents, and payment information for the same.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mhada-lottery-mumbai/132034.html)\n\n[![The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region\")\n\nThe Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region\n\nMira Bhayandar micro market has undergone a radical economic metamorphosis. The area is becoming a self-contained urban center through better transportation, civic facilities, organized retail, and education, among other factors.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/rise-of-mira-bhayandar-in-mumbai-metropolitan-region/150744.html)\n\n[![Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More\")\n\nBhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More\n\nBhumi Pednekar doesn’t need any introduction. This blog covers everything you need to know about her lavish sea-facing apartment in Mumbai. Read on.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-bhumi-pednekar-house/129959.html)\n\n[![Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know\")\n\nAsalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know\n\nAsalpha metro is an important station on Mumbai's Blu